<title>JAPAN: TENNIS-SELES OUT OF JAPAN TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SELES OUT OF JAPAN TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>World number two Monica Seles, already sitting out the Australian Open because of a broken finger, has now withdrawn from the Toray Indoor tournament in Tokyo from January 28 to February 2, organisers said on Friday.</p>
</text>
